  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"409\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"89\">• About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"92\">Cherisity is an online retailer specializing in <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"164\">customizable jewelry</strong>, offering personalized items such as <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"252\">projection bracelets, necklaces, and keychains</strong>. Our products are designed to transform cherished photos or messages into <strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"348\">eternal keepsakes</strong>, allowing customers to express love and preserve memories.</p><p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"441\">• What makes us different:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"916\"><li data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"541\"><p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"470\">Personalized design:</strong> Customers can upload photos or text to create unique jewelry pieces.</p></li><li data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"692\"><p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"567\">Projection feature:</strong> Some products include micro-projection technology that reveals hidden images or messages when viewed through a smartphone.</p></li><li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"807\"><p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"807\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"722\">High-quality materials:</strong> Every piece is crafted with premium materials for durability and aesthetic appeal.</p></li><li data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"916\"><p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"916\"><strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"830\">Global shipping:</strong> We provide international delivery, making it easy for customers worldwide to order.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1119\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"948\">• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\">Affiliates earn <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1005\">commission on every sale generated</strong> through their unique referral links. There’s <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1076\">no minimum withdrawal</strong>, and commissions are <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1116\">settled weekly</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1147\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1145\">• How to promote us:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1409\"><li data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1251\"><p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1251\">Share product photos and videos on social media platforms like <strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1248\">Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1334\"><p data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1334\">Highlight the <strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1309\">customization and projection features</strong> to attract engagement.</p></li><li data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1409\"><p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1409\">Use your <strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1391\">personal affiliate link or discount codes</strong> to drive sales.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1437\"><strong data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1435\">• Other information:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1763\"><li data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1493\"><p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1493\"><strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1452\">Website:</strong> <a data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1491\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\">cherisity.com</a></p></li><li data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1530\"><p data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1530\"><strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1506\">Email:</strong> <a data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1528\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">support@cherisity.com</a></p></li><li data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1566\"><p data-start=\"1533\"